flowchart TB
    accTitle: The reaction on a text
    accDescr: The maintainer writes a text to the bot, and the pager sends it to the control repository and reacts with 👀. When the answer or a proposal comes, the 👀 becomes 👍. When the job fails, it becomes 😢, and so does it when no answer came within an hour, which the schedule finds every 15 minutes. An answer that comes after that still turns it into 👍.

    dennis["The maintainer writes a text to the bot"]
    taken["`**👀** The pager sends it to the control repository, which runs Claude`"]
    answered["`**👍** The answer or a proposal came, with its footer, such as Opus 5.5 · high · 48,213 tokens`"]
    failed["`**😢** No answer: the job failed, or none came within an hour`"]

    dennis --> taken
    taken -- "the answer" --> answered
    taken -- "the job failed, or the schedule finds it after an hour" --> failed
    failed -- "a late answer" --> answered

    classDef you fill:#f59e0b2e,stroke:#f59e0b,stroke-width:2px
    classDef bot fill:#526cfe2e,stroke:#526cfe,stroke-width:2px
    classDef done fill:#16a34a2e,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    classDef warn fill:#dc26262e,stroke:#dc2626,stroke-width:2px
    class dennis you
    class taken bot
    class answered done
    class failed warn
